      "description": "Global Energy Monitor Global Integrated Power Tracker, a Generator fleet dataset, published as XLSX, available at https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-integrated-power-tracker/download-data/. Form-gated download, so it fails the anonymous-access criterion and lands Tier 2 despite being otherwise model-ready. Unit-level global coverage across eight technology trackers. Commercial-use exemption process exists separately. This entry has not been through licence and access-path review; its licence and tier are not authoritative until a steward confirms them.",
